  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Vulnerability Reduction Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the intervention is to support the implementation of the Moldovan Government&apos;s Energy Vulnerability Reduction Fund (EVRF) during the 2024-2025 heating season, as to address the energy vulnerability of people in Moldova. As a result, at least 120,000 households, deemed as eligible for energy compensations during the 2024-2025 heating season by the Moldovan Government, will benefit from financial support via the EVRF. The compensation is calculated individually based on household income, size and composition, and type of primary heating source (gas, electricity, thermal energy or solid fuel). The EVRF  promotes energy savings by compensating for 80% of the average household&apos;s consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
